msgid ""
"Instalment due on the last day of each month of the taxation year. Income "
"Tax Act s. 157(1)(a). https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"
msgstr ""
"Acompte exigible le dernier jour de chaque mois de l'année d'imposition. Loi"
" de l'impôt sur le revenu, alinéa 157(1)a). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/lois/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cit_instalment_quarterly_federal
msgid ""
"Small Canadian-controlled private corporation: instalment due on the last "
"day of each quarter of the taxation year. Income Tax Act s. 157(1.1). "
"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"
msgstr ""
"Petite société privée sous contrôle canadien : acompte exigible le dernier "
"jour de chaque trimestre de l'année d'imposition. Loi de l'impôt sur le "
"revenu, paragraphe 157(1.1). https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/lois/I-3.3/"
" https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cit_instalment_monthly_quebec
msgid ""
"Instalment due on or before the last day of each month of the taxation year."
" Taxation Act (Quebec) s. 1027(a)(i). "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/en/document/cs/I-3"
msgstr ""
"Acompte exigible au plus tard le dernier jour de chaque mois de l'année "
"d'imposition. Loi sur les impôts (Québec), art. 1027 a) i). "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/fr/document/lc/I-3"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cit_instalment_quarterly_quebec
msgid ""
"Qualified Canadian-controlled private corporation: instalment due on or "
"before the last day of each three-month period of the taxation year. "
"Taxation Act (Quebec) ss. 1027(a)(iii) and 1027.0.1. "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/en/document/cs/I-3"
msgstr ""
"Société privée sous contrôle canadien admissible : acompte exigible au plus "
"tard le dernier jour de chaque période de trois mois de l'année "
"d'imposition. Loi sur les impôts (Québec), art. 1027 a) iii) et 1027.0.1. "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/fr/document/lc/I-3"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cit_balance_federal
msgid ""
"Balance-due day of a corporation: end of the second month after the end of "
"the taxation year. Income Tax Act ss. 157(1)(b) and 248(1) balance-due day. "
"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"
msgstr ""
"Date d'exigibilité du solde d'une société : fin du deuxième mois suivant la "
"fin de l'année d'imposition. Loi de l'impôt sur le revenu, alinéa 157(1)b) "
"et paragraphe 248(1), « date d'exigibilité du solde ». https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/lois/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cit_balance_federal_ccpc
msgid ""
"Balance-due day of a CCPC that claims the small business deduction and whose"
" taxable income of the previous year does not exceed its business limit: end"
" of the third month after the end of the taxation year. Income Tax Act s. "
"248(1) balance-due day (d)(i). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"
msgstr ""
"Date d'exigibilité du solde d'une SPCC qui demande la déduction accordée aux"
" petites entreprises et dont le revenu imposable de l'année précédente ne "
"dépasse pas son plafond des affaires : fin du troisième mois suivant la fin "
"de l'année d'imposition. Loi de l'impôt sur le revenu, paragraphe 248(1), « "
"date d'exigibilité du solde », alinéa d)(i). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/lois/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cit_balance_quebec
msgid ""
"Balance-due day of a corporation: last day of the two-month period ending "
"after the end of the taxation year, CCPC included. Taxation Act (Quebec) ss."
" 1 balance-due day and 1027(b). "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/en/document/cs/I-3"
msgstr ""
"Date d'exigibilité du solde d'une société : dernier jour de la période de "
"deux mois qui suit la fin de l'année d'imposition, SPCC comprise. Loi sur "
"les impôts (Québec), art. 1, « date d'exigibilité du solde », et art. 1027 "
"b). https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/fr/document/lc/I-3"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_t2_return
msgid ""
"Return due within six months after the end of the taxation year. Income Tax "
"Act s. 150(1)(a). https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"
msgstr ""
"Déclaration exigible dans les six mois suivant la fin de l'année "
"d'imposition. Loi de l'impôt sur le revenu, alinéa 150(1)a). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/lois/I-3.3/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_co17_return
msgid ""
"Return due within six months from the end of the taxation year. Taxation Act"
" (Quebec) s. 1000(2)(a). "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/en/document/cs/I-3"
msgstr ""
"Déclaration exigible dans les six mois suivant la fin de l'année "
"d'imposition. Loi sur les impôts (Québec), art. 1000(2)a). "
"https://www.legisquebec.gouv.qc.ca/fr/document/lc/I-3"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_federal_quarterly
msgid ""
"Quarterly remitter: due on the 15th day of the month after each calendar "
"quarter. Income Tax Regulations s. 108(1.12). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/C.R.C.,_c._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement trimestriel : versement exigible le 15e jour du mois "
"suivant chaque trimestre civil. Règlement de l'impôt sur le revenu, "
"paragraphe 108(1.12). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/reglements/C.R.C.,_ch._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_federal_regular
msgid ""
"Regular remitter: due on the 15th day of the month after the month the "
"remuneration is paid. Income Tax Regulations s. 108(1). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/C.R.C.,_c._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement régulier : versement exigible le 15e jour du mois "
"suivant le mois du paiement de la rémunération. Règlement de l'impôt sur le "
"revenu, paragraphe 108(1). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/reglements/C.R.C.,_ch._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_federal_accelerated_1
msgid ""
"Accelerated threshold 1: remuneration paid from the 1st to the 15th is due "
"on the 25th of the month, from the 16th to the end of the month on the 10th "
"of the next month. Income Tax Regulations s. 108(1.1)(a). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/C.R.C.,_c._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement accéléré – seuil 1 : la rémunération versée du 1er au "
"15e jour est à verser le 25 du mois, celle du 16e jour à la fin du mois, le "
"10 du mois suivant. Règlement de l'impôt sur le revenu, alinéa 108(1.1)a). "
"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/reglements/C.R.C.,_ch._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_federal_accelerated_2
msgid ""
"Accelerated threshold 2: due the 3rd working day after the 7th, the 14th, "
"the 21st and the last day of the month. Income Tax Regulations s. "
"108(1.1)(b). https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/C.R.C.,_c._945/"
" https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement accéléré – seuil 2 : versement exigible le 3e jour "
"ouvrable suivant le 7, le 14, le 21 et le dernier jour du mois. Règlement de"
" l'impôt sur le revenu, alinéa 108(1.1)b). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/reglements/C.R.C.,_ch._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-"
"agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll/remitting-source-"
"deductions/how-when-remit-due-dates.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_quebec_annual
msgid ""
"Annual remitter (source deductions and employer contributions of the "
"previous year of $2,400 or less): due on the 15th day of the month after the"
" last month of the year, January 15 in most cases. Guide for employers "
"TP-1015.G, Table 7. A day the offices of Revenu Quebec are closed is not a "
"business day, as the guide states. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement annuel (retenues à la source et cotisations de "
"l'employeur de l'année précédente de 2 400 $ ou moins) : versement exigible "
"le 15e jour du mois suivant le dernier mois de l'année, le 15 janvier dans "
"la plupart des cas. Guide de l'employeur TP-1015.G, tableau 7. Un jour de "
"fermeture des bureaux de Revenu Québec n'est pas un jour ouvrable, comme "
"l'indique le guide. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-"
"deductions-and-employer-contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-"
"employer-contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_quebec_quarterly
msgid ""
"Quarterly remitter: due on the 15th day of the month after each calendar "
"quarter. Guide for employers TP-1015.G. A day the offices of Revenu Quebec "
"are closed is not a business day, as the guide states. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement trimestriel : versement exigible le 15e jour du mois "
"suivant chaque trimestre civil. Guide de l'employeur TP-1015.G. Un jour de "
"fermeture des bureaux de Revenu Québec n'est pas un jour ouvrable, comme "
"l'indique le guide. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-"
"deductions-and-employer-contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-"
"employer-contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_quebec_monthly
msgid ""
"Monthly remitter: due on the 15th day of the month after the month the "
"remuneration is paid. Guide for employers TP-1015.G. A day the offices of "
"Revenu Quebec are closed is not a business day, as the guide states. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement mensuel : versement exigible le 15e jour du mois suivant"
" le mois du paiement de la rémunération. Guide de l'employeur TP-1015.G. Un "
"jour de fermeture des bureaux de Revenu Québec n'est pas un jour ouvrable, "
"comme l'indique le guide. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-"
"deductions-and-employer-contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-"
"employer-contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_quebec_twice_monthly
msgid ""
"Twice-monthly remitter: remuneration paid from the 1st to the 15th is due on"
" the 25th, from the 16th to the end of the month on the 10th of the next "
"month. Guide for employers TP-1015.G. A day the offices of Revenu Quebec are"
" closed is not a business day, as the guide states. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement deux fois par mois : la rémunération versée du 1er au "
"15e jour est à verser le 25, celle du 16e jour à la fin du mois, le 10 du "
"mois suivant. Guide de l'employeur TP-1015.G. Un jour de fermeture des "
"bureaux de Revenu Québec n'est pas un jour ouvrable, comme l'indique le "
"guide. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-"
"employer-contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_payroll_quebec_weekly
msgid ""
"Weekly remitter: due the 3rd business day after the 7th, the 14th, the 21st "
"and the last day of the month. Guide for employers TP-1015.G. A day the "
"offices of Revenu Quebec are closed is not a business day, as the guide "
"states. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-"
"employer-contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"
msgstr ""
"Auteur de versement hebdomadaire : versement exigible le 3e jour ouvrable "
"suivant le 7, le 14, le 21 et le dernier jour du mois. Guide de l'employeur "
"TP-1015.G. Un jour de fermeture des bureaux de Revenu Québec n'est pas un "
"jour ouvrable, comme l'indique le guide. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/remitting-source-deductions-and-employer-"
"contributions/frequency-of-remittances/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_t4_summary
msgid ""
"T4 information return due on or before the last day of February of the "
"following calendar year. Income Tax Regulations ss. 200(1) and 205(1). "
"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/C.R.C.,_c._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"
msgstr ""
"Déclaration de renseignements T4 exigible au plus tard le dernier jour de "
"février de l'année civile suivante. Règlement de l'impôt sur le revenu, "
"paragraphes 200(1) et 205(1). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/reglements/C.R.C.,_ch._945/ "
"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/resources-for-small-and-medium-"
"businesses/2026-tax-deadlines-canadian-businesses-self-employed-"
"individuals.html"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_t5_summary
msgid ""
"T5 information return (dividends, interest) due on or before the last day of"
" February of the following calendar year. Income Tax Regulations ss. 201(1) "
"and 205(1). https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/C.R.C.,_c._945/"
msgstr ""
"Déclaration de renseignements T5 (dividendes, intérêts) exigible au plus "
"tard le dernier jour de février de l'année civile suivante. Règlement de "
"l'impôt sur le revenu, paragraphes 201(1) et 205(1). https://laws-"
"lois.justice.gc.ca/fra/reglements/C.R.C.,_ch._945/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_rl1_summary
msgid ""
"RL slips and RL-1 summary due by the last day of February of the following "
"year, together with the labour standards (CNT) contribution, the WSDRF "
"(FDRCMO) contribution if any, and the part of the Health Services Fund "
"balance caused by the gap between the actual and the estimated rate. The "
"balance of Quebec income tax withheld and of QPP and QPIP contributions "
"(summary line 48) is due with the last December remittance, not with the "
"summary; paid with the summary, it bears interest and may bring a penalty. "
"TP-1015.G, ss. 11.3 and 11.6. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/rl-"
"slips-and-summaries/sending-rl-slips-and-summaries/filing-deadline/"
msgstr ""
"Relevés et sommaire 1 (RL-1) exigibles au plus tard le dernier jour de "
"février de l'année suivante, avec la cotisation relative aux normes du "
"travail (CNT), la cotisation au FDRCMO s'il y a lieu et la partie du solde "
"de la cotisation au Fonds des services de santé qui résulte de l'écart entre"
" le taux réel et le taux estimatif. Le solde des retenues d'impôt du Québec "
"et des cotisations au RRQ et au RQAP (ligne 48 du sommaire) se paie avec le "
"dernier paiement de décembre, et non à la production du sommaire; payé avec "
"le sommaire, il porte intérêt et une pénalité peut s'ajouter. TP-1015.G, "
"parties 11.3 et 11.6. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/rl-slips-"
"and-summaries/sending-rl-slips-and-summaries/filing-deadline/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_hsf_reconciliation
msgid ""
"The employer contribution to the Health Services Fund of the year is "
"reconciled on the RL-1 summary, due by the last day of February of the "
"following year. Only the part of the balance caused by the gap between the "
"actual and the estimated contribution rate is payable by that date; the rest"
" of the HSF balance is due with the last December remittance. TP-1015.G, ss."
" 6.6 and 11.6. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/rl-slips-and-"
"summaries/sending-rl-slips-and-summaries/filing-deadline/"
msgstr ""
"La cotisation de l'employeur au Fonds des services de santé de l'année est "
"conciliée dans le sommaire 1 (RL-1), exigible au plus tard le dernier jour "
"de février de l'année suivante. Seule la partie du solde qui résulte de "
"l'écart entre le taux de cotisation réel et le taux de cotisation estimatif "
"est payable à cette date; le reste du solde de la cotisation au FSS se paie "
"avec le dernier paiement de décembre. TP-1015.G, parties 6.6 et 11.6. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/rl-slips-and-summaries/sending-rl-"
"slips-and-summaries/filing-deadline/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_rl3_summary
msgid ""
"RL-3 slips (investment income) and summary due by the last day of February "
"of the following year. https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/rl-slips-"
"and-summaries/sending-rl-slips-and-summaries/filing-deadline/"
msgstr ""
"Relevés 3 (revenus de placement) et sommaire exigibles au plus tard le "
"dernier jour de février de l'année suivante. "
"https://www.revenuquebec.ca/en/businesses/rl-slips-and-summaries/sending-rl-"
"slips-and-summaries/filing-deadline/"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_cnesst_wages
msgid ""
"Statement of the gross wages of the previous year, to be sent before March "
"15: the last day is March 14. An employer whose last worker leaves sends it "
"at the latest 45 days after that departure. Act respecting industrial "
"accidents and occupational diseases, s. 291, and its regulation on the "
"statement of wages. No weekend postponement is applied: the CNESST publishes"
" none. https://www.cnesst.gouv.qc.ca/fr/demarches-"
"formulaires/employeurs/assurance-sante-securite-travail/obligations-"
