#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_req_annual_update_combined
msgid ""
"Legal person whose annual updating declaration is combined with its income "
"tax return: due no later than six months after the end of its fiscal year. "
"Act respecting the legal publicity of enterprises. "
"https://www.quebec.ca/entreprises-et-travailleurs-autonomes/mettre-a-jour-"
"informations/declaration-mise-a-jour/annuelle"
msgstr ""
"Personne morale dont la déclaration de mise à jour annuelle est jointe à sa "
"déclaration de revenus : exigible au plus tard six mois après la fin de son "
"exercice. Loi sur la publicité légale des entreprises. "
"https://www.quebec.ca/entreprises-et-travailleurs-autonomes/mettre-a-jour-"
"informations/declaration-mise-a-jour/annuelle"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_req_fee_combined
msgid ""
"Legal person whose annual updating declaration is combined with its income "
"tax return: annual registration fee payable no later than two months after "
"the end of its fiscal year. https://www.quebec.ca/entreprises-et-"
"travailleurs-autonomes/mettre-a-jour-informations/declaration-mise-a-"
"jour/annuelle"
msgstr ""
"Personne morale dont la déclaration de mise à jour annuelle est jointe à sa "
"déclaration de revenus : droits annuels d'immatriculation payables au plus "
"tard deux mois après la fin de son exercice. "
"https://www.quebec.ca/entreprises-et-travailleurs-autonomes/mettre-a-jour-"
"informations/declaration-mise-a-jour/annuelle"

#. module: l10n_ca_tax_calendar
#: model:l10n.ca.tax.deadline.rule,description:l10n_ca_tax_calendar.rule_req_annual_update
msgid ""
"Legal person whose declaration is not combined with its income tax return: "
"filing period from May 15 to November 15 of each year. "
"https://www.quebec.ca/entreprises-et-travailleurs-autonomes/mettre-a-jour-"
"informations/declaration-mise-a-jour/annuelle"
msgstr ""
"Personne morale dont la déclaration n'est pas jointe à sa déclaration de "
"revenus : période de production du 15 mai au 15 novembre de chaque année. "
"https://www.quebec.ca/entreprises-et-travailleurs-autonomes/mettre-a-jour-"
"informations/declaration-mise-a-jour/annuelle"
